TITLE Pyrite oxidation with O2(g) fixed; allow pyrite to oxidize (REACTION), precipitate goethite/gypsum
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Goethite 0 0
    Gypsum 0 0
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure true
    -pressure 1
    O2(g) -0.7
REACTION 1
    Pyrite 1
    0.1
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected2.txt
    -reset false
    -pH true
END
